      "observation": "The first frame is active: giant tilted GENESIS 4 with fracture lines. The title settles and contracts, then changes to THE BROTHER’S BLOOD in a geometric vortex by 2.4 seconds. A distinct plain-clothed Jesus landscape follows at 5.7 seconds. The later restrained photo hold follows two active compositions and does not reproduce the prior slow twelve-second opening."
