      ],
      "observation": "Reading poses keep lyrics large, high contrast and inside the frame. Red keyword accents and white connectors work across serif, stencil, distressed, condensed and bold faces. The firstborn/fatlings three-row composition is dense but readable. No visible clipping or unintended collisions at the sampled poses."
    },
    {
      "category": "semanticMotion",
      "result": "Pass with minor repetition",
      "evidence": [
