        "scenes-3.png"
      ],
      "observation": "Scale, typeface and graphic changes create quick succession. The held Be still passage provides a meaningful rest. Fracture/vortex motifs repeat enough to be noticeable, but the variation is sufficient for delivery and does not justify another finishing loop."
    },
    {
      "category": "clubFight",
      "result": "Pass",
      "evidence": [
        "fight-1.png"
      ],
      "observation": "Cain’s raised wooden club and Abel’s defensive posture read clearly in the gritty photo. KILLED and BROTHER occupy open upper-left space without covering faces or weapon. This is a still-photo support treatment with changing typography; the samples do not demonstrate a literal animated club strike."
    },
    {
