      "observation": "The cut at about 102.27 seconds moves coherently from the struggle to bowed Cain and plain-clothed human Jesus. THE LORD GOD ASKED CAIN is readable in the open center/lower region by 104.5 seconds. The next graphic scene begins cleanly at the boundary."
    },
